                     218     ;======================= mode 1: binary piano ==========================
                     219     ; The buttons S5 S4 S3 S2 are the bits 8 4 2 1 of a number n. Hold one
                     220     ; or more: the display shows the four bits and the buzzer plays note n
                     221     ; of the scale (1 = C6 ... 8 = C7 ... 15 = C8). 10 s idle: back to menu.
